      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:173cf987634ed90a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Day 13 · After breakfast, full-day excursion to the high-altitude lagoons of Miscanti and Miñiques, lunch in Socaire, a small village about 100 km south-east of San Pedro, then the Atacama Salt Flat, the Chaxa Lagoon and the National Flamingo Reserve, home to three of the world’s six flamingo species. Continue to Toconao and its San Lucas Church and bell tower. Return to San Pedro.",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a79e349361b041abd487321297a1dd9b8fc648435fa32531cf2cf5db25a55193",
